---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Co-productions"
  description="Halfway Up Productions specialises in UK-India co-productions, leveraging bilateral treaties to tell cross-cultural stories with global appeal."
>
  <Header />

  <main>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="bg-primary text-white section-padding grain-texture">
      <div class="container-custom max-w-4xl text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold mb-6">
          Bridging UK and India through cinema
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl opacity-90">
          We specialise in international co-productions that bring together talent, funding, and stories from across borders.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Treaty Benefits -->
    <section class="section-padding bg-cream">
      <div class="container-custom max-w-4xl">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-semibold mb-8">Why UK-India co-productions?</h2>
        <p class="text-lg mb-8">
          The UK-India bilateral co-production treaty, active since 2008, offers unprecedented opportunities for filmmakers looking to tell stories that span cultures and continents.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="card p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-secondary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-secondary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-semibold mb-2">Dual nationality status</h3>
                <p class="text-muted">
                  Co-produced films are treated as national productions in both countries, unlocking local funding and distribution advantages.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-secondary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-secondary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-semibold mb-2">Tax relief & incentives</h3>
                <p class="text-muted">
                  Access to UK tax relief (up to 25%) and Indian incentives, plus BFI and other funding opportunities.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-secondary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-secondary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-semibold mb-2">Expanded talent pool</h3>
                <p class="text-muted">
                  Collaborate with world-class talent from both the UK and Indian film industries.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-secondary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-secondary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-semibold mb-2">Global market access</h3>
                <p class="text-muted">
                  Built-in distribution pathways to both UK and Indian markets, plus international appeal.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Our Interest -->
    <section class="section-padding bg-white">
      <div class="container-custom max-w-4xl">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-semibold mb-6">What we're looking for</h2>
        <p class="text-lg mb-8">
          We're interested in stories that authentically explore the connections between UK and Indian cultures, told with nuance, warmth, and emotional truth.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-secondary flex-shrink-0 mt-1" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-1">Contemporary stories exploring cultural connections</h3>
              <p class="text-muted">Modern narratives that reflect today's global, interconnected world.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-secondary flex-shrink-0 mt-1" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-1">Diaspora narratives</h3>
              <p class="text-muted">Stories of identity, belonging, and the spaces between cultures.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-secondary flex-shrink-0 mt-1" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-1">Cross-cultural relationships</h3>
              <p class="text-muted">Love, friendship, and family across borders and traditions.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-secondary flex-shrink-0 mt-1" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-1">Female-driven stories</h3>
              <p class="text-muted">Projects centred on women's experiences and perspectives.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA Section -->
    <section class="section-padding bg-cream">
      <div class="container-custom max-w-3xl text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-semibold mb-4">Looking for a UK co-producing partner?</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-muted mb-8">
          We're actively seeking co-production opportunities with Indian producers, financiers, and creative teams. If you have a project that bridges cultures and resonates emotionally, let's talk.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">
          Get in touch
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
